{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30105","headline":"慈恩寺塔下避暑 · 刘得仁","name":"慈恩寺塔下避暑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古松凌巨塔，修竹映空廊。\n竟日闻虚籁，深山只此凉。\n僧真生我静，水淡发茶香。\n坐久东楼望，钟声振夕阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}